/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (A\040field\040study\040of\040group\040diversity\054\040participation\040in\040diversity\040education\040programs\054\040and\040performance)
/Author (Robin\040J\056\040Ely)
/Subject (Summary\040This\040study\040examined\040the\040impact\040of\040four\040dimensions\040of\040diversity\204tenure\054\040age\054\040sex\054\040and\040race\204\040on\040performance\040in\040486\040retail\040bank\040branches\040and\040assessed\040whether\040employee\040participation\040in\040the\040firm\220s\040diversity\040education\040programs\040influenced\040these\040relationships\056\040Data\040came\040from\040archives\040of\040the\040demographic\040composition\040of\040branches\054\040an\040employee\040attitude\205satisfaction\040poll\054\040and\040branch\040performance\040assessed\040as\040part\040of\040the\040bank\220s\040bonus\040incentive\040plan\056\040Race\040and\040sex\040diversity\040were\040unrelated\040to\040performance\056\040The\040direct\040effects\040of\040tenure\040and\040age\040diversity\040were\040largely\040negative\054\040but\040were\040moderated\040by\040quality\040of\040team\040processes\054\040suggesting\040that\040cooperation\040and\040teamwork\040may\040suppress\040potentially\040task\055enhancing\040differences\040associated\040with\040these\040aspects\040of\040diversity\056\040Diversity\040education\040programs\040had\040minimal\040impact\040on\040performance\056\040The\040results\040of\040this\040study\040suggest\040that\040there\040is\040a\040complex\040relationship\040between\040age\040and\040tenure\040diversity\040and\040performance\040and\040that\054\040even\040in\040firms\040with\040characteristics\040that\040should\040be\040conducive\040to\040performance\040benefits\040from\040diversity\054\040other\040conditions\040must\040be\040in\040place\040to\040foster\040such\040effects\056\040Copyright\040\043\0402004\040John\040Wiley\040\046\040Sons\054\040Ltd\056)
